{%- comment -%}
  WeightRx — Tirzepatide Landing Page (mobile + desktop)
  Two layouts in one self-contained section:
    • .wrx-mobile  — the approved mobile design (port of ui_kits/.../index.html), shown < 900px
    • .wrx-desktop — a real wide desktop layout (port of responsive.html), shown >= 900px
  They swap by CSS, so the mobile version is byte-for-byte unchanged while desktop fills the screen.
  Self-contained: ships its own tokens, fonts and CSS. Use with layout/landing.liquid.

  All CTA pills link to the experiment funnel URL (editable in the schema).
{%- endcomment -%}

